        "collapsible_tab_tUEYBx": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why are your perfumes so affordable?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p><strong>Our perfumes are affordable because we focus on what matters most: the scent itself. At the same time, we cut out unnecessary costs.</strong></p><p>✔️<strong>No expensive marketing</strong><br/><br/>We don't spend money on celebrity campaigns or over-the-top luxury branding. That<br/>lets us keep prices lower.</p><p>✔️<strong>Simple, elegant packaging</strong><br/><br/>Instead of expensive designer bottles, we use clean, minimalist<br/>packaging that keeps production costs down.</p><p>✔️<strong>Direct to customer</strong><br/><br/>By selling online and bottling ourselves, we avoid middlemen and<br/>retail markups.</p><p>✔️<strong>Alternative compositions with a premium feel</strong><br/><br/>We create scents inspired by well-known favorites, focusing on quality, longevity and the feeling you want to wear.</p><p><strong>The result?</strong><br/><br/>You get long-lasting, high-quality perfumes at a price that feels fair</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_nhKiAc": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it real perfume?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p><strong>Our scents are far from ordinary perfumed water.</strong></p><p>At Try Scent we offer high-quality <strong>Eau de Parfum (EDP) </strong>with a perfume oil concentration of <strong>19–21%</strong>.<br/>That gives a scent that lasts long, comes through clearly and gains more depth on the skin.</p><p>Unlike light body sprays or simpler scented waters, our compositions are made to last for many hours, often until the next day.</p><p><em>You get an intense and elegant fragrance experience at a fraction of the price<br/>of luxury brands</em></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_pCrhqV": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Our perfumes are made to last.",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>Thanks to a high perfume oil concentration of <strong>19–21% </strong>most of our scents stay clearly noticeable on the skin for up to <strong>24 hours</strong>. Often the scent can still be noticed on clothes or in your hair the next day.</p><p>Exact longevity of course depends on the scent itself, your skin type and how the perfume is applied.</p><p>But compared to many simpler alternatives or lighter <strong>Eau de Toilette</strong>, Try Scent gives a noticeably stronger and longer-lasting fragrance experience.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_gkD4Ei": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is the inspired fragrance different?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>No — our inspired fragrances are designed as an <strong>exact copy</strong> of the originals from famous luxury brands. We carefully recreate the same fragrance structure, using identical scent notes and raw materials wherever possible.</p><p>✔️ <strong>1:1 fragrance impression</strong> – The scent is virtually indistinguishable from the original, even for experienced perfume lovers.<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Same longevity and projection</strong> – Thanks to the high concentration of perfume oils (19-21%), our fragrances last just as long as the originals.<br/><br/>✔️ <strong>Affordable price, no compromise</strong> – You get the exact same olfactory experience without paying for the logo, marketing, or designer packaging.</p><p>In short: Our perfumes are identical to luxury brands in scent, quality, and durability — the only difference is the price.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_pdYPYn": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What does 19–21% perfume oil mean?",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>The percentage shows how much of the fragrance is made up of pure perfume oils.</p><p>At Try Scent our perfumes contain <strong>19–21% perfume oil</strong>, which puts them at the upper end of <strong>Eau<br/>de Parfum (EDP)</strong>, one of the most intense fragrance types for everyday use.</p><p>✔️<strong>Eau de Parfum quality</strong><br/><br/>With 19–21% perfume oil you get a clearer, deeper and longer-lasting scent than lighter alternatives.</p><p>✔️<strong>Long-lasting</strong><br/><br/>The high concentration keeps the scent on your skin for many hours, often until the next day.</p><p>✔️<strong>Better projection and more depth</strong><br/><br/>The scent develops in layers and keeps its character longer, instead of<br/>fading quickly after application.</p><p><strong>For comparison:</strong></p><p><strong>Eau de Toilette:</strong> usually around 5–15% perfume oil.<br/><br/><strong>Eau de Parfum:</strong> usually around 15–25% perfume oil.<br/><br/><strong>Parfum/Extrait:</strong> often 25% or more, but<br/>usually at a significantly higher price.</p><p><strong>In short:</strong><br/><br/>With 19–21% you get an intense, long-lasting, high-quality fragrance experience, perfect if you want the feel and performance of a designer fragrance at a more reasonable price.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_F64PJg": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What are the perfumes made of? (Ingredients)",
            "icon": "perfume",
            "content": "<p>Alcohol Denat., Parfum (Fragrance), Aqua (Water), Limonene, Linalool,<br/>Citronellol, Geraniol, Citral, Benzyl Salicylate, Coumarin, Alpha-Isomethyl<br/>Ionone, Hexyl Cinnamal, Benzyl Benzoate.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_ydfzCq": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Disclaimer",
            "icon": "star",
            "content": "<p>All fragrance references are intended as a guide only and should under no<br/>circumstances be confused with original products from well-known designer, high street or niche brands. Names, trademarks and copyrights, whether mentioned or not, belong to their respective manufacturers and/or designers.</p><p>Our scents are only inspired by other fragrance profiles and are not identical to any other perfume or original fragrance.</p><p>Magyx perfumes should not be confused with original products and we have no<br/>affiliation with the manufacturers behind these designer or niche brands.</p><p>All trademarks, whether mentioned or not, belong to their respective owners. We are not endorsed by, sponsored by, maintained by, directly affiliated with<br/>or otherwise connected to any trademark holder that may be referenced, directly or indirectly.</p><p>Product names are used for identification and reference purposes only and do not imply any connection, association or affiliation with the respective trademark holder.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
