        "description": "<p>At Magyx, we believe in fragrances that make you feel amazing. That's why we offer a 60-day money-back guarantee—so you can shop with confidence.</p><p>If you're not completely in love with your scent, simply return it within 60 days for a full refund. No hassle, no stress—just a promise that you'll find a fragrance you truly adore.</p>",
